  unitName: Blissful Arms Douglas (EU)
  unitId: 730125
  unitNumber: 7016
  description: A magical machine gunner who forages in the Vriksha Duchy. Historical
    texts tell of how he challenged tens of thousands of gods on his own before suffering
    a fatal wound. However, there is a handful of documents chronicling his actions
    afterwards. It seems he had disappeared into a gate to the otherworld just before
    dying. As the war and mankind itself drew to an end, Douglas and his immensely
    powerful magic gattling gun once again stood in defience before the army of gods.
  summonDesc: So you called me here?<br>Then let's go!<br>We've no time to chat!
  fusionDesc: Surely you understand?<br>The value of what I wanted<br>and of what
    I received...
  evoDesc: The battlefield calls me.<br>That's why I've returned.<br>There's no other
    reason.
  element: 3
  rarity: 5
